    "title": "Wood Turning 3D - Carving Game",
    "description": "This is a great wood turning simulation when using a wood lathe with hand tools to cut a symmetrical shape around the spindle. Hone your brain for the skill or ability to craft great products at your home.\r\n\r\nIt is you against material science and uncertainty\r\nWould you like you to consider wood turning such a favorite?\r\n\r\nThe more successful you are, the more money you earn, and they can be used to unlock new game skins!\r\n\r\nHow to play the game of turning wood\r\n- Just swipe to cut wood in shape wood pattern.\r\n- Decorate your wood with multiple colors and decals.\r\n- Receive money to unlock new skin.",
